  "issues_for_review": [
    "The updated cell-center model spans about 279 km east-west by 228 km north-south; this broad frame is intentionally preserved in the current baseline with cropApplied false.",
    "The model vertical range reaches about -122 km elevation through 3.45 km from the source header's Elevation (m) field; presentation copy should explain this carefully before client-facing use.",
    "The model includes 316 zero-or-negative resistivity rows, which cannot be log10-colored directly. Current GeoSee previews mask those rows.",
    "The DAT header says NAD83 but does not name UTM Zone 12N; the included PRJ confirms NAD_1983_UTM_Zone_12N for the shapefile/export package.",
    "EDI station coordinates are latitude/longitude/elevation, while model files are UTM meters. The current shared scene transform is documented in crs_transform.json."
  ],
